{"agent":"resume-pssnap2","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B16e0083f21: `ddflow wait --timeout 6297` prints 'waiting at most 1800s at a time; resume with the token to wait longer' and exits 2 after 1800s, but the token appears only under --json (wake.token); in text mode the advised resume is impossible, and the follow-up line says only to run `ddflow wait` again. Found on PS-snapshot-calibrate.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B16e0083f21 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B16e0083f21 --regression-test <test>` first).\n\nNot attached, they match nothing in the tree: ddflow/infra/store/snapshot.py, tests/test_snapshot_calibrate.py, ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/knob_added.log.snapshot_max_mb.toml, ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/knob_changed.log.snapshot.toml, ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/knob_changed.log.max_cached_events.toml.","fixes":["B16e0083f21"],"globs":["ddflow/infra/log/_read.py","ddflow/infra/log/_parse.py","ddflow/infra/log/_guard.py","tests/test_fsio_paths.py","tests/test_fsio_log.py","tests/test_log_snapshot.py","tests/test_log_snapshot_knobs.py","tests/test_compat_derived.py","tests/test_log_read_cache_config.py","tests/test_upgrade_apply_knobs.py","ddflow/templates/upgrade/changes.toml","ddflow/config_sections/log.py","README.md"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug B16e0083f21: ddflow wait text output says resume with the token but never prints it"},"id":"e2db8b8a5b4296b1e6ad7c7f6","kind":"task.added","lamport":140545,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B16e0083f21","ts":"2026-11-05T14:49:33.156079Z"}
